RRB.load({"id":"ntpc-2025-aug-29-s2","exam":"ntpc","label":"NTPC UG CBT 1 · 29 Aug 2025 · Shift 2","time":"12:45 PM - 2:15 PM","dropped":0,"questions":[{"s":"General Awareness","q":"Which of the following subjects was NOT a part of the Transferred Subjects under the Government of India Act of 1919?","o":["Local self-government","Police","Health","Education"],"a":1,"e":"Under dyarchy (GoI Act 1919), police was a reserved subject. Local government, health and education were transferred.","qh":"निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सा विषय 1919 के भारत सरकार अधिनियम के तहत हस्तांतरित विषयों का भाग नहीं था?","eh":"द्वैध शासन (भारत सरकार अधिनियम 1919) में पुलिस आरक्षित विषय था। स्थानीय शासन, स्वास्थ्य और शिक्षा हस्तांतरित विषय थे।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"Which of the following properties generally increases across a period (left to right) in the periodic table?","o":["Reduction","Ionisation enthalpy","Metallic character","Atomic radius"],"a":1,"e":"Across a period, nuclear charge rises and atomic size falls, so ionisation enthalpy generally increases.","qh":"आवर्त सारणी में निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सा गुणधर्म सामान्यतः एक आवर्त में (बाएं से दाएं) बढ़ता है?","eh":"आवर्त में आगे बढ़ने पर नाभिकीय आवेश बढ़ता है और परमाणु आकार घटता है, इसलिए आयनन एन्थैल्पी सामान्यतः बढ़ती है।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"Who was appointed as the Chairman of the Union Public Service Commission (UPSC) in 2025, succeeding Preeti Sudan?","o":["Sanjay Mitra","Anil Swarup","Ajay Kumar","Rajiv Gauba"],"a":2,"e":"Ajay Kumar, former Defence Secretary, became UPSC Chairman in May 2025 after Preeti Sudan.","qh":"प्रीति सूदन के बाद, वर्ष 2025 में, संघ लोक सेवा आयोग (UPSC) के अध्यक्ष के रूप में किसे नियुक्त किया गया?","oh":["संजय मित्रा (Sanjay Mitra)","अनिल स्वरूप (Anil Swarup)","अजय कुमार (Ajay Kumar)","राजीव गौबा (Rajiv Gauba)"],"eh":"पूर्व रक्षा सचिव अजय कुमार प्रीति सूदन के बाद मई 2025 में UPSC के अध्यक्ष बने।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"Yagnavarman, Sardulavarman and Anantavarman were the kings of which of the following kingdoms?","o":["Magadha Guptas","Maitrakas of Valabhi","Maukharis of Kanauj","Pushyabhutis of Thanesar"],"a":2,"e":"Yajnavarman, Shardulavarman and Anantavarman were Maukhari rulers, with Kanauj as their later capital.","qh":"यज्ञ वर्मन, शार्दुल वर्मन और अनंतवर्मन निम्नलिखित में से किस राज्य के राजा थे?","eh":"यज्ञवर्मन, शार्दूलवर्मन और अनंतवर्मन मौखरि शासक थे, जिनकी बाद की राजधानी कन्नौज थी।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"Before becoming the Chief Justice of India, Justice BR Gavai served in which court?","o":["Delhi High Court","Allahabad High Court","Bombay High Court","Madras High Court"],"a":2,"e":"Justice B.R. Gavai was a judge of the Bombay High Court before joining the Supreme Court.","qh":"भारत के मुख्य न्यायाधीश बनने से पहले, न्यायमूर्ति बी.आर. गवई किस न्यायालय में कार्यरत थे?","eh":"न्यायमूर्ति बी.आर. गवई सर्वोच्च न्यायालय में आने से पहले बॉम्बे उच्च न्यायालय के न्यायाधीश थे।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"What is the purpose of the submarine cable project launched by the Indian National Centre for Ocean Information Services (INCOIS) in 2025?","o":["Improve underwater defense systems","Support ocean tourism","Increase internet speed in coastal areas","Enhance long-term Indian Ocean observations"],"a":3,"e":"INCOIS's submarine cable project is for sustained, long-term observation of the Indian Ocean.","qh":"भारतीय राष्ट्रीय महासागर सूचना सेवा केन्द्र (INCOIS) द्वारा 2025 में लॉन्च की गई पनडुब्बी केबल प्रोजेक्ट का उद्देश्य क्या है?","eh":"INCOIS की पनडुब्बी केबल परियोजना हिंद महासागर के निरंतर, दीर्घकालिक अवलोकन के लिए है।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"A solution with a pH of 2 is how many times more acidic than a solution with pH 4?","o":["10 times","2 times","100 times","200 times"],"a":2,"e":"Each pH unit is a 10× change, so pH 2 is 10² = 100 times more acidic than pH 4.","qh":"pH 2 वाला विलयन, pH 4 वाले विलयन से कितने गुना अधिक अम्लीय है?","oh":["10 गुना","2 गुना","100 गुना","200 गुना"],"eh":"pH की प्रत्येक इकाई 10 गुना परिवर्तन दर्शाती है, अतः pH 2, pH 4 से 10² = 100 गुना अधिक अम्लीय है।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"The spread of the Green Revolution technology enabled India to achieve self- sufficiency in __________.","o":["sugarcane","vegetables","oil seeds","food grains"],"a":3,"e":"The Green Revolution made India self-sufficient in food grains.","qh":"हरित क्रांति प्रौद्योगिकी के प्रसार ने भारत को __________________ में आत्मनिर्भरता हासिल करने में सक्षम बनाया।","eh":"हरित क्रांति ने भारत को खाद्यान्न में आत्मनिर्भर बनाया।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"Which postulate of Dalton’s atomic theory explains the Law of Definite Proportions?","o":["Atoms are indivisible and indestructible.","Atoms of different elements have different masses and properties.","Atoms of the same element are identical in mass and size.","Atoms combine in simple whole-number ratios to form compounds."],"a":3,"e":"Atoms combine in fixed, simple whole-number ratios, which explains the law of definite proportions.","qh":"डाल्टन के परमाणु सिद्धांत का कौन-सी परिकल्पना निश्चित अनुपात के नियम की व्याख्या करती है?","eh":"परमाणु निश्चित, सरल पूर्ण संख्या अनुपात में संयोग करते हैं, जो स्थिर अनुपात के नियम की व्याख्या करता है।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"Which ISRO mission, launched in May 2025, aims to enhance India's all-weather day- and-night Earth observation capabilities?","o":["INSAT-3DS","Cartosat-3","RISAT-1B","EOS-09"],"a":3,"e":"EOS-09 (RISAT-1B), a C-band SAR satellite launched on PSLV-C61 in May 2025, gives all-weather imaging.","qh":"मई 2025 में लॉन्च किए गए इसरो के किस मिशन का उद्देश्य भारत की सभी मौसमों में दिन-रात, पृथ्वी अवलोकन क्षमताओं (Earth observation capabilities) को बढ़ाना है?","oh":["INSAT-3DS","Cartosat-3","RISAT-1B","EOS-09"],"eh":"मई 2025 में PSLV-C61 से प्रक्षेपित C-बैंड SAR उपग्रह EOS-09 (RISAT-1B) हर मौसम में चित्र प्रदान करता है।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"Who among the following translated the book ‘Heart Lamp’ from Kannada to English, for which the author won the prestigious International Booker Prize in May 2025?","o":["Manorama Mishra","Deepa Bhasthi","Chitra Banerjee Divakaruni","Geeta Singh"],"a":1,"e":"Deepa Bhasthi translated Banu Mushtaq's 'Heart Lamp'.","qh":"निम्नलिखित में से किसने पुस्तक 'हार्ट लैंप (Heart Lamp’)' को कन्नड़ से अंग्रेजी में अनुवाद किया, जिसके लिए मई 2025 में प्रतिष्ठित इंटरनेशनल बुकर पुरस्कार दिया गया?","oh":["मनोरमा मिश्रा","दीपा भस्थी","चित्रा बनर्जी दिवाकरुनी","गीता सिंह"],"eh":"दीपा भास्थी ने बानू मुश्ताक की 'हार्ट लैम्प' का अनुवाद किया।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"Which Article of the Indian Constitution empowers the Parliament and State Legislatures to make laws for the whole or any part of the territory of India?","o":["Article 250","Article 245","Article 249","Article 256"],"a":1,"e":"Article 245 sets the territorial extent of laws made by Parliament and state legislatures.","qh":"भारतीय संविधान का कौन-सा अनुच्छेद, संसद और राज्य विधायिकाओं को भारत के संपूर्ण क्षेत्र या उसके किसी भाग के लिए कानून बनाने का अधिकार देता है?","oh":["अनुच्छेद 250","अनुच्छेद 245","अनुच्छेद 249","अनुच्छेद 256"],"eh":"अनुच्छेद 245 संसद और राज्य विधानमंडलों द्वारा बनाए गए कानूनों का क्षेत्रीय विस्तार निर्धारित करता है।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"What happened to employment opportunities after the 1991 reforms?","o":["Stayed the same","Increased, especially in private and service sectors","Decreased in all sectors","Only grew in agriculture"],"a":1,"e":"After 1991, jobs grew mainly in the private and services sectors.","qh":"1991 के सुधारों के बाद रोजगार के अवसरों का क्या हुआ?","eh":"1991 के बाद रोजगार मुख्यतः निजी और सेवा क्षेत्रों में बढ़ा।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"The largest area of the Great Indian Desert in India is located in which state?","o":["Gujarat","Rajasthan","Punjab","Haryana"],"a":1,"e":"Most of the Thar Desert lies in Rajasthan.","qh":"भारत में विस्तृत भारतीय मरुस्थल (ग्रेट इंडियन डेजर्ट) का सबसे बड़ा क्षेत्र किस राज्य में स्थित है?","oh":["गुजरात","राजस्थान","पंजाब","हरियाणा"],"eh":"थार मरुस्थल का अधिकांश भाग राजस्थान में है।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"Which agency on 2025 authorised to share information with the Enforcement Directorate (ED) under the Prevention of Money Laundering Act to combat cyber fraud?","o":["Indian Cyber Crime Coordination Centre (I4C)","Central Bureau of Investigation (CBI)","National Cyber Crime Reporting Portal (NCRP)","Cyber and Information Security Division (CISD)"],"a":0,"e":"In 2025 the I4C was notified under PMLA to share information with the ED.","qh":"2025 में, साइबर ठगी से निपटने के लिए धन-शोधन निवारण अधिनियम के तहत प्रवर्तन निदेशालय (ED) के साथ सूचना साझा करने के लिए किस एजेंसी को अधिकृत किया गया?","oh":["भारतीय साइबर अपराध समन्वय केंद्र (I4C)","केंद्रीय अन्वेषण ब्यूरो (CBI)","राष्ट्रीय साइबर अपराध रिपोर्टिंग पोर्टल (NCRP)","साइबर एवं सूचना सुरक्षा प्रभाग (CISD)"],"eh":"2025 में I4C को ED के साथ सूचना साझा करने के लिए PMLA के तहत अधिसूचित किया गया।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"In January 2025, which state cricket association unveiled plans to construct the largest cricket stadium in India, with a seating capacity of 1.25 lakh spectators?","o":["Odisha Cricket League","Punjab Cricket Association","Delhi District Cricket Association","Andhra Cricket Association"],"a":3,"e":"The Andhra Cricket Association plans a 1.25 lakh-seat stadium at Amaravati.","qh":"जनवरी 2025 में, किस राज्य क्रिकेट संघ ने 1.25 लाख दर्शकों की क्षमता वाले भारत के सबसे बड़े क्रिकेट स्टेडियम के निर्माण की योजना का अनावरण किया?","eh":"आंध्र क्रिकेट संघ अमरावती में 1.25 लाख सीटों वाला स्टेडियम बनाने की योजना बना रहा है।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"Which of the following is a mode of losing Indian citizenship?","o":["Renunciation","Birth","Registration","Naturalization"],"a":0,"e":"Citizenship can be lost by renunciation, termination or deprivation (Citizenship Act 1955).","qh":"निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सा भारतीय नागरिकता खोने का एक तरीका है?","eh":"नागरिकता त्याग, समाप्ति या वंचन द्वारा खोई जा सकती है (नागरिकता अधिनियम 1955)।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"In which year was the Paris Agreement adopted?","o":["2015","2013","2016","2017"],"a":0,"e":"The Paris Agreement was adopted at COP21 in 2015.","qh":"पेरिस समझौता किस वर्ष अपनाया गया था?","oh":["2015","2013","2016","2017"],"eh":"पेरिस समझौता 2015 में COP21 में अपनाया गया।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"In the context of British plantations in India, what does the term ‘bigha’ refer to?","o":["A unit of measurement of land","A plant that replaced indigo in Britain","An agreement made with the ryots","A revenue estate which has one or more villages"],"a":0,"e":"A bigha is a traditional unit of land measurement.","qh":"भारत में ब्रिटिश वृक्षारोपण के संदर्भ में, 'बीघा (bigha)' शब्द का क्या अर्थ है?","eh":"बीघा भूमि मापन की एक पारंपरिक इकाई है।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"Which of the following accurately represents the two main components of the CPU and their functions?","o":["Monitor and Keyboard – Control the speed of data processing","RAM and ROM – Store data and instructions permanently","HDD and SSD – Perform data input and output tasks","ALU and CU – Perform calculations and control all computer operations"],"a":3,"e":"The CPU's two main parts are the ALU (calculations) and the CU (controls operations).","qh":"निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सा विकल्प, CPU के दो मुख्य घटकों और उनके कार्यों को परिशुद्ध रूप से निरूपित करता है?","eh":"CPU के दो मुख्य भाग ALU (गणनाएँ) और CU (संचालन नियंत्रण) हैं।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"What are quaternary activities mainly associated with?","o":["Transportation","Industrial work","Information and research","Agriculture"],"a":2,"e":"Quaternary activities are knowledge-based: information, research and development.","qh":"चतुर्थक गतिविधियां मुख्यतः किससे संबंधित होती हैं?","eh":"चतुर्थक गतिविधियाँ ज्ञान-आधारित होती हैं: सूचना, अनुसंधान और विकास।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"Which of the following Five-Year Plans was based on the Harrod-Domar Model?","o":["First","Third","Fifth","Seventh"],"a":0,"e":"The First Five Year Plan used the Harrod–Domar growth model.","qh":"निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सी पंचवर्षीय योजना हैरोड-डोमर मॉडल (Harrod-Domar Model) पर आधारित थी?","eh":"पहली पंचवर्षीय योजना में हैरोड–डोमर वृद्धि मॉडल का उपयोग हुआ।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"In FIFO scheduling, which process is executed first?","o":["The process with the shortest execution time","The process that arrives first","The process with the highest priority","The process that arrives last"],"a":1,"e":"FIFO (first-in, first-out) runs the process that arrived first.","qh":"FIFO शेड्यूलिंग में, कौन-सा प्रोसेस पहले निष्पादित होता है?","eh":"FIFO (फर्स्ट-इन, फर्स्ट-आउट) पहले आने वाली प्रक्रिया को पहले चलाता है।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"Where was the 12th World Government Summit, 2025, held?","o":["Delhi, India","Muscat, Oman","Riyadh, Saudi Arabia","Dubai, UAE"],"a":3,"e":"The 12th World Government Summit (2025) was held in Dubai, UAE.","qh":"12वां विश्व सरकार शिखर सम्मेलन, 2025, कहाँ आयोजित किया गया था?","oh":["दिल्ली, भारत","मस्कट, ओमान","रियाद, सऊदी अरब","दुबई, UAE"],"eh":"12वाँ विश्व सरकार शिखर सम्मेलन (2025) दुबई, UAE में आयोजित हुआ।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"What is the general slope of the Deccan Plateau?","o":["North to South","West to East","South to North","East to West"],"a":1,"e":"The Deccan Plateau slopes from west to east, so most rivers flow east into the Bay of Bengal.","qh":"दक्कन पठार का सामान्य ढाल किस तरफ है?","eh":"दक्कन का पठार पश्चिम से पूर्व की ओर ढलान वाला है, इसलिए अधिकांश नदियाँ पूर्व की ओर बहकर बंगाल की खाड़ी में गिरती हैं।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"During which period of Indian history were the stupas of Sanchi and Sarnath built, reflecting its architectural style?","o":["Gupta rule","Kushan rule","Mauryan rule","Vakataka rule"],"a":2,"e":"The Sanchi and Sarnath stupas began under Mauryan rule (Ashoka).","qh":"भारतीय इतिहास के किस काल में साँची और सारनाथ के स्तूपों का निर्माण किया गया, जो इसकी स्थापत्य शैली को दर्शाते हैं?","oh":["गुप्त शासन","कुषाण शासन","मौर्य शासन","वाकाटक शासन"],"eh":"साँची और सारनाथ के स्तूपों का निर्माण मौर्य शासन (अशोक) में शुरू हुआ।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"Which of the following countries was elected to the Vice Presidency of the International Association of Marine Aids to Navigation and Lighthouse Authorities (IALA) in 2025?","o":["France","Japan","Australia","India"],"a":3,"e":"India was elected Vice-President of IALA in 2025.","qh":"निम्नलिखित में से किस देश को 2025 में इंटरनेशनल एसोसिएशन ऑफ मरीन एड्स टू नेविगेशन एंड लाइटहाउस अथॉरिटीज़ (IALA) के उपाध्यक्ष पद के लिए चयनित किया गया था?","oh":["फ्रांस","जापान","ऑस्ट्रेलिया","भारत"],"eh":"भारत को 2025 में IALA का उपाध्यक्ष चुना गया।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"Who among the following strongly criticised British education for being too Western and disconnected from Indian realities?","o":["Charles Wood","Rabindranath Tagore","Raja Rammohan Roy","Macaulay"],"a":1,"e":"Rabindranath Tagore criticised colonial schooling as mechanical and cut off from Indian life and nature.","qh":"निम्नलिखित में से किसने ब्रिटिश शिक्षा की अत्यधिक पश्चिमी होने तथा भारतीय वास्तविकताओं से अलग होने के कारण कड़ी आलोचना की?","oh":["चार्ल्स वुड","रवीन्द्रनाथ टैगोर","राजा राममोहन राय","मैकाले"],"eh":"रवींद्रनाथ टैगोर ने औपनिवेशिक शिक्षा की आलोचना की कि वह यांत्रिक है और भारतीय जीवन व प्रकृति से कटी हुई है।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"The 'Nuclear Energy Mission for Viksit Bharat' aims to achieve how much nuclear energy capacity by 2047?","o":["75 GW","125 GW","50 GW","100 GW"],"a":3,"e":"The Nuclear Energy Mission targets 100 GW of nuclear capacity by 2047.","qh":"2047 तक 'विकसित भारत के लिए परमाणु ऊर्जा मिशन (Nuclear Energy Mission for Viksit Bharat)' का लक्ष्य कितनी परमाणु ऊर्जा क्षमता हासिल करना है?","oh":["75 GW","125 GW","50 GW","100 GW"],"eh":"परमाणु ऊर्जा मिशन का लक्ष्य 2047 तक 100 GW परमाणु क्षमता है।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"Which Indo-Greek ruler's envoy Heliodorus installed a pillar in Vidisha and was a devotee of Lord Krishna?","o":["Diodotus","Demetrius","Antialkidas","Menander"],"a":2,"e":"Heliodorus, envoy of the Indo-Greek king Antialkidas, set up the Garuda pillar at Vidisha (Besnagar).","qh":"निम्नलिखित में से किस इंडो-ग्रीक (Indo-Greek) शासक का राजदूत हेलियोडोरस (Heliodorus), भगवान कृष्ण का भक्त था और उसने विदिशा में एक स्तंभ स्थापित किया था?","oh":["डायोडोटस (Diodotus)","डेमेट्रियस (Demetrius)","एन्टिआलकिडस (Antialkidas)","मेनांडर (Menander)"],"eh":"हिंद-यवन राजा एंटियालकिडस के राजदूत हेलियोडोरस ने विदिशा (बेसनगर) में गरुड़ स्तंभ स्थापित किया।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"The famous male torso from Harappa, remarkable for its naturalistic pose and chiselled in the round, is made of ___________.","o":["steatite","red limestone","bronze","terracotta"],"a":1,"e":"The Harappan male torso is a red stone sculpture carved in the round. The key gives red limestone (NCERT calls it red sandstone).","qh":"हड़प्पा से प्राप्त प्रसिद्ध पुरुष धड़, जो अपनी प्राकृतिक मुद्रा और गोलाकार नक्काशी के लिए प्रसिद्ध है, ___________ का बना है।","oh":["स्टीऐटाइट","लाल चूना पत्थर","कांस्य","टेराकोटा"],"eh":"हड़प्पा का पुरुष धड़ लाल पत्थर की चारों ओर से तराशी गई मूर्ति है। उत्तर कुंजी में लाल चूना पत्थर दिया है (NCERT इसे लाल बलुआ पत्थर कहता है)।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"Ashok Chandra assumed charge as Managing Director and Chief Executive Officer of ____________ on 16th January 2025.","o":["Punjab National Bank","Central Bank of India","Canara Bank","Union Bank of India"],"a":0,"e":"Ashok Chandra became MD & CEO of Punjab National Bank in January 2025.","qh":"अशोक चंद्रा ने 16 जनवरी 2025 को ____________ के प्रबंध निदेशक और मुख्य कार्यकारी अधिकारी के रूप में पदभार ग्रहण किया।","eh":"अशोक चंद्र जनवरी 2025 में पंजाब नेशनल बैंक के MD और CEO बने।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"What is the projected valuation of India's satellite communication (satcom) market by 2028?","o":["$10 billion","$20 billion","$5 billion","$15 billion"],"a":1,"e":"India's satcom market is projected to reach about $20 billion by 2028.","qh":"2028 तक भारत के उपग्रह संचार (सैटकॉम) बाज़ार का प्रस्तावित मानांकन (Projected valuation) कितना है?","oh":["$10 बिलियन","$20 बिलियन","$5 बिलियन","$15 बिलियन"],"eh":"भारत का सैटकॉम बाज़ार 2028 तक लगभग $20 बिलियन तक पहुँचने का अनुमान है।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"Canal irrigation is best suited for which of the following geographical regions?","o":["High mountain regions","Rocky plateaus","River basins and flat lands","Desert regions"],"a":2,"e":"Canals suit flat river basins with perennial water.","qh":"निम्नलिखित में से किस भौगोलिक क्षेत्र के लिए नहर सिंचाई सबसे उपयुक्त है?","eh":"नहरें सदानीरा जल वाले समतल नदी बेसिनों के लिए उपयुक्त हैं।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"Under what conditions can the Parliament legislate on matters in the State List according to constitutional provisions?","o":["When the Rajya Sabha passes a resolution.","During a national emergency declared under Article 352.","If the President signs a proclamation without Parliament's involvement.","If a Governor requests it due to a financial emergency in the state."],"a":0,"e":"Under Article 249, if the Rajya Sabha passes a resolution by a 2/3 majority, Parliament can legislate on a State List subject.","qh":"संवैधानिक प्रावधानों के अनुसार संसद किन परिस्थितियों में राज्य सूची के मामलों पर कानून (legislate) बना सकती है?","eh":"अनुच्छेद 249 के तहत, यदि राज्यसभा 2/3 बहुमत से प्रस्ताव पारित करे, तो संसद राज्य सूची के विषय पर कानून बना सकती है।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"By when has India aimed to achieve its defence production of ₹3 lakh crore, which will strengthen its position as a global defence manufacturing hub?","o":["2032","2029","2028","2030"],"a":1,"e":"India aims for ₹3 lakh crore of defence production by 2029.","qh":"भारत ने कब तक अपना रक्षा उत्पादन ₹3 लाख करोड़ प्राप्त करने का लक्ष्य रखा है, जिससे वैश्विक रक्षा विनिर्माण केंद्र के रूप में इसकी स्थिति मजबूत होगी?","oh":["2032","2029","2028","2030"],"eh":"भारत का लक्ष्य 2029 तक ₹3 लाख करोड़ का रक्षा उत्पादन है।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"Which initiative was launched to provide reliable electricity to all households in India, especially in rural areas?","o":["UJALA Scheme","Shakti Scheme","Saubhagya Scheme","GARV Dashboard"],"a":2,"e":"The Saubhagya scheme (2017) aimed to electrify every household.","qh":"भारत में सभी घरों, विशेषकर ग्रामीण क्षेत्रों में, को विश्वसनीय विद्युत्उपलब्ध कराने के लिए कौन-सा कार्यक्रम लॉन्च किया गया है?","oh":["उजाला योजना (UJALA Scheme)","शक्ति योजना (Shakti Scheme)","सौभाग्य योजना (Saubhagya Scheme)","गर्व डैशबोर्ड (GARV Dashboard)"],"eh":"सौभाग्य योजना (2017) का उद्देश्य हर घर का विद्युतीकरण था।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"Who among the following passed an Act in 1898, making it an offence to provoke people against the British rulers?","o":["Lord Curzon","Lord Northbrook","Lord Elgin","Lord Mayo"],"a":0,"e":"The 1898 sedition amendments (IPC 124A/153A) came under Lord Elgin II. Curzon became Viceroy only in January 1899. Note: possible key error.","qh":"1898 में निम्नलिखित में से किसने एक ऐसा अधिनियम पारित किया था, जिसके तहत ब्रिटिश शासकों के विरुद्ध लोगों को भड़काने के कृत्य को अपराध श्रेणी में शामिल किया गया?","oh":["लॉर्ड कर्जन","लॉर्ड नॉर्थब्रुक","लॉर्ड एल्गिन","लॉर्ड मेयो"],"eh":"1898 के राजद्रोह संशोधन (IPC 124A/153A) लॉर्ड एल्गिन द्वितीय के समय हुए। कर्ज़न जनवरी 1899 में ही वायसराय बने। नोट: उत्तर कुंजी में त्रुटि संभव है।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"The process of planet formation through collision and sticking of small celestial bodies is called:","o":["Fragmentation","Degassing","Differentiation","Accretion"],"a":3,"e":"Accretion is the growth of planets as small bodies collide and stick together.","qh":"लघु खगोलीय पिंडों के संघट्टन और संलगन से ग्रह निर्माण की प्रक्रिया को क्या कहा जाता है?","oh":["विखंडन (Fragmentation)","विगैसन (Degassing)","विभेदन (Differentiation)","अभिवृद्धि (accretion)"],"eh":"अभिवृद्धि (एक्रीशन) वह प्रक्रिया है जिसमें छोटे पिंड टकराकर जुड़ते हैं और ग्रह बढ़ते हैं।"},{"s":"General Awareness","q":"Lok Adalats in India have statutory status under which of the following enactments?","o":["The Civil Procedure Code, 1908","The Indian Penal Code, 1860","The Legal Services Authorities Act, 1987","The Arbitration and Conciliation Act, 1996"],"a":2,"e":"Lok Adalats get statutory status from the Legal Services Authorities Act, 1987.","qh":"भारत में लोक अदालतों को निम्नलिखित में से किस अधिनियम के तहत वैधानिक दर्जा प्राप्त है?","oh":["सिविल प्रक्रिया संहिता, 1908","भारतीय दंड संहिता, 1860","विधिक सेवा प्राधिकरण अधिनियम, 1987","मध्यस्थता और सुलह अधिनियम, 1996"],"eh":"लोक अदालतों को विधिक सेवा प्राधिकरण अधिनियम, 1987 से वैधानिक दर्जा मिलता है।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"A can do a work in 12 days and B can do the same work in 25 days. If they work on it together for 6 days, then what fraction of the work is left?","o":["","","",""],"a":2,"oi":["data/img/ntpc-2025-aug-29-s2/001ma-o1.png","data/img/ntpc-2025-aug-29-s2/001ma-o2.png","data/img/ntpc-2025-aug-29-s2/001ma-o3.png","data/img/ntpc-2025-aug-29-s2/001ma-o4.png"],"e":"In 6 days: 6 × (1/12 + 1/25) = 37/50 done, so 13/50 is left.","qh":"A किसी कार्य को 12 दिनों में कर सकता है और B उसी कार्य को 25 दिनों में कर सकता है। यदि वे 6 दिनों तक एक साथ इस पर कार्य करते हैं, तो कार्य का कितना भाग शेष रह जाएगा?","eh":"6 दिनों में: 6 × (1/12 + 1/25) = 37/50 कार्य पूरा, अतः 13/50 शेष है।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"Evaluate: (-9) - (-60) ÷ (-10) + (-3) × 9","o":["-42","-44","-45","-41"],"a":0,"e":"−9 − 6 + (−27) = −42, since (−60) ÷ (−10) = 6.","qh":"निम्नलिखित का मान ज्ञात कीजिए: (-9) - (-60) ÷ (-10) + (-3) × 9","oh":["-42","-44","-45","-41"],"eh":"−9 − 6 + (−27) = −42, क्योंकि (−60) ÷ (−10) = 6।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"The HCF and the LCM of two numbers are 18 and 216, respectively. If one of the numbers is 72, find the other one.","o":["25","10","54","5"],"a":2,"e":"Other number = 18 × 216/72 = 54.","qh":"दो संख्याओं का महत्तम समापवर्तक (H.C.F.) और लघुत्तम समापवर्त्य (L.C.M.) क्रमशः 18 और 216 है। यदि इनमें से एक संख्या 72 है, तो दूसरी संख्या ज्ञात कीजिए।","oh":["25","10","54","5"],"eh":"दूसरी संख्या = 18 × 216/72 = 54।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"If the 6-digit number N36M77 is divisible by 11, then which of the options below can give a possible correct relation between M and N?","o":["M + N = -3","M - N = 3","M - N = 1","M = N"],"a":1,"e":"(N + 6 + 7) − (3 + M + 7) = N − M + 3 = 0, so M − N = 3.","qh":"यदि 6 अंकों की संख्या N36M77, 11 से विभाज्य है, तो नीचे दिए गए विकल्पों में से कौन-सा विकल्प, M और N के बीच संभावित सही संबंध दे सकता है?","oh":["M + N = -3","M - N = 3","M - N = 1","M = N"],"eh":"(N + 6 + 7) − (3 + M + 7) = N − M + 3 = 0, अतः M − N = 3।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"The product of two positive numbers is 245. If the first number is five times the second number, then the sum of the two numbers is:","o":["38","51","40","42"],"a":3,"e":"5x² = 245, so x = 7. The numbers are 35 and 7, and the sum = 42.","qh":"दो धनात्मक संख्याओं का गुणनफल 245 है। यदि पहली संख्या दूसरी संख्या की पाँच गुनी है, तो दोनों संख्याओं का योग ज्ञात कीजिए।","oh":["38","51","40","42"],"eh":"5x² = 245, अतः x = 7। संख्याएँ 35 और 7 हैं, और योग = 42।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"Train A leaves station M at 8:35 AM and reaches station N at 3:35 PM on the same day. Train B leaves station N at 10:35 AM and reaches station M at 3:35 PM on the same day. Find the time when trains A and B meet.","o":["11:50 AM","12:40 PM","12:10 PM","12:50 PM"],"a":1,"e":"A takes 7 h and B takes 5 h. By 10:35 A has covered 2/7. The remaining 5/7 at 12/35 per hour takes 25/12 h = 2 h 5 min, so they meet at 12:40 PM.","qh":"ट्रेन A, स्टेशन M से 8:35 AM पर निकलती है और उसी दिन 3:35 PM पर स्टेशन N पर पहुँचती है। ट्रेन B, स्टेशन N से 10:35 AM पर निकलती है और उसी दिन 3:35 PM पर स्टेशन M पर पहुँचती है। ट्रेन A और B के मिलने का समय ज्ञात कीजिए।","oh":["11:50 AM","12:40 PM","12:10 PM","12:50 PM"],"eh":"A को 7 घंटे और B को 5 घंटे लगते हैं। 10:35 तक A ने 2/7 दूरी तय कर ली। शेष 5/7, 12/35 प्रति घंटा की दर से 25/12 घंटे = 2 घंटे 5 मिनट में तय होगी, अतः वे 12:40 PM पर मिलेंगे।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"If the third proportional of 8 and 16 be x, then what is the value of x?","o":["31","34","32","35"],"a":2,"e":"x = 16²/8 = 32.","qh":"यदि 8 और 16 का तृतीयानुपाती x है, तो x का मान कितना है?","oh":["31","34","32","35"],"eh":"x = 16²/8 = 32।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"A bus travelling at 10 km/hr completes a journey in 16 hours. At what speed will it have to cover the same distance in 8 hours?","o":["14 km/hr","10 km/hr","20 km/hr","25 km/hr"],"a":2,"e":"Distance = 160 km, so 160/8 = 20 km/h.","qh":"10 km/hr की चाल से चलने वाली एक बस एक यात्रा 16 घंटे में पूरी करती है। 8 घंटे में समान दूरी तय करने के लिए उसे किस चाल से यात्रा करनी होगी?","oh":["14 km/hr","10 km/hr","20 km/hr","25 km/hr"],"eh":"दूरी = 160 km, अतः 160/8 = 20 km/h।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"Praveen and Hemant start a business. Praveen invests ₹78,000 more than Hemant for 5 months and Hemant invests for 6 months. Praveen's share is ₹1,360 more than that of Hemant, out of a total profit of ₹5,440. Find the capital contributed by Praveen.","o":["₹1,56,000","₹1,55,955","₹1,55,875","₹1,56,185"],"a":0,"e":"Shares are 3400 and 2040, a ratio of 5 : 3 = 5(x + 78000) : 6x. So x = 78000 and Praveen's capital = ₹1,56,000.","qh":"प्रवीण और हेमंत एक व्यवसाय शुरू करते हैं। प्रवीण 5 महीने के लिए हेमंत से ₹78,000 अधिक निवेश करता है और हेमंत 6 महीने के लिए निवेश करता है। ₹5,440 के कुल लाभ में से प्रवीण का हिस्सा, हेमंत के हिस्से से ₹1,360 अधिक है। प्रवीण द्वारा निवेशित पूँजी ज्ञात कीजिए।","oh":["₹1,56,000","₹1,55,955","₹1,55,875","₹1,56,185"],"eh":"हिस्से 3400 और 2040 हैं, अनुपात 5 : 3 = 5(x + 78000) : 6x। अतः x = 78000 और प्रवीण की पूँजी = ₹1,56,000।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"Sapna invested ₹22,800 on simple interest, partly at 5% per annum and partly at 11% per annum. If she earns equal interests from the two investments after 4 years, then find the sum invested at 5% per annum (in ₹).","o":["15,676","15,675","15,678","15,677"],"a":1,"e":"5x = 11(22800 − x), so 16x = 250800 and x = ₹15,675.","qh":"सपना ने ₹22,800 की राशि को साधारण ब्याज पर आंशिक रूप से 5% वार्षिक और आंशिक रूप से 11% वार्षिक दर से निवेश किया। यदि उसे 4 वर्षों के बाद दोनों निवेशों से समान ब्याज मिलता है, तो 5% वार्षिक की दर से निवेश की गई राशि (₹ में) ज्ञात कीजिए।","oh":["15,676","15,675","15,678","15,677"],"eh":"5x = 11(22800 − x), अतः 16x = 250800 और x = ₹15,675।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"","o":["","","",""],"a":0,"img":"data/img/ntpc-2025-aug-29-s2/011ma-q0.png","oi":["data/img/ntpc-2025-aug-29-s2/011ma-o1.png","data/img/ntpc-2025-aug-29-s2/011ma-o2.png","data/img/ntpc-2025-aug-29-s2/011ma-o3.png","data/img/ntpc-2025-aug-29-s2/011ma-o4.png"],"e":"1 + tan θ + cot θ = (1 + sin θ cos θ)/(sin θ cos θ), so the first term = sec θ − cosec θ. The other two add to 2cosec θ. Total = sec θ + cosec θ.","eh":"1 + tan θ + cot θ = (1 + sin θ cos θ)/(sin θ cos θ), अतः पहला पद = sec θ − cosec θ। अन्य दो का योग 2cosec θ है। कुल = sec θ + cosec θ।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"","o":["","","",""],"a":2,"img":"data/img/ntpc-2025-aug-29-s2/012ma-q0.png","oi":["data/img/ntpc-2025-aug-29-s2/012ma-o1.png","data/img/ntpc-2025-aug-29-s2/012ma-o2.png","data/img/ntpc-2025-aug-29-s2/012ma-o3.png","data/img/ntpc-2025-aug-29-s2/012ma-o4.png"],"e":"1/(1 + 2/7) = 7/9. 4/3 + 7/9 − 2/3 = (12 + 7 − 6)/9 = 13/9.","eh":"1/(1 + 2/7) = 7/9। 4/3 + 7/9 − 2/3 = (12 + 7 − 6)/9 = 13/9।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"The average of first 159 even numbers is","o":["161","160.5","159.5","160"],"a":3,"e":"The average of the first n even numbers = n + 1 = 160.","qh":"प्रथम 159 सम संख्याओं का औसत ज्ञात कीजिए।","oh":["161","160.5","159.5","160"],"eh":"पहली n सम संख्याओं का औसत = n + 1 = 160।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"Given that 112⁰·⁵⁷ = x, 112⁰·⁸ = y and xᶻ = y⁶, then the value of z is close to:","o":["10.14","9.12","8.45","8.42"],"a":3,"e":"x^z = y⁶ gives 0.57z = 0.8 × 6 = 4.8, so z ≈ 8.42.","qh":"दिया गया है कि 1120.57 = x, 1120.8 = y और x = y6 है, तो z का मान _________ के सन्निकट है।","oh":["10.14","9.12","8.45","8.42"],"eh":"x^z = y⁶ से 0.57z = 0.8 × 6 = 4.8, अतः z ≈ 8.42।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"Find the effective discount for the scheme – Buy 12, get 8 free.","o":["10%","21%","40%","20%"],"a":2,"e":"8 free out of 20 items = 40% effective discount.","qh":"'12 खरीदें, 8 मुफ़्त में पाएं', स्कीम के लिए प्रभावी छूट ज्ञात कीजिए।","oh":["10%","21%","40%","20%"],"eh":"20 वस्तुओं में से 8 मुफ्त = 40% प्रभावी छूट।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"","o":["","","",""],"a":3,"img":"data/img/ntpc-2025-aug-29-s2/016ma-q0.png","oi":["data/img/ntpc-2025-aug-29-s2/016ma-o1.png","data/img/ntpc-2025-aug-29-s2/016ma-o2.png","data/img/ntpc-2025-aug-29-s2/016ma-o3.png","data/img/ntpc-2025-aug-29-s2/016ma-o4.png"],"e":"P fills the tank in 80 h and Q in 20 h. In 4 h they fill 1/4, which R empties in 8 h, so R = 1/32. P + Q − R = 1/80 + 1/20 − 1/32 = 1/32, i.e. 32 hours.","eh":"P टंकी को 80 घंटे में और Q 20 घंटे में भरता है। 4 घंटे में वे 1/4 भरते हैं, जिसे R 8 घंटे में खाली करता है, अतः R = 1/32। P + Q − R = 1/80 + 1/20 − 1/32 = 1/32, अर्थात 32 घंटे।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"If 4 times a son's age is added to his father's age, the sum is 46 years. If 2.8 times the father's age is added to the son's age, the sum is 88 years. What is the father's age (in years)?","o":["35","25","28","30"],"a":3,"e":"4s + f = 46 and s + 2.8f = 88, which gives f = 30.","qh":"यदि एक पिता की आयु में उसके पुत्र की आयु का 4 गुना जोड़ा जाए, तो योग 46 वर्ष होता है। यदि पिता की आयु का 2.8 गुना, उसके पुत्र की आयु में जोड़ा जाए, तो योग 88 वर्ष होता है। पिता की आयु (वर्ष में) ज्ञात कीजिए।","oh":["35","25","28","30"],"eh":"4s + f = 46 और s + 2.8f = 88, जिससे f = 30।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"If the radius of the base of a right circular cylinder is decreased by 46% and its height is increased by 261%, then what is the percentage increase (closest integer) in its volume?","o":["5%","35%","17%","19%"],"a":0,"e":"New volume = 0.54² × 3.61 = 1.0527 of the old, about a 5% increase.","qh":"यदि एक लम्ब वृत्तीय बेलन के आधार की त्रिज्या 46% कम कर दी जाए तथा इसकी ऊंचाई 261% बढ़ा दी जाए, तो इसके आयतन में प्रतिशत वृद्धि (निकटतम पूणाेंक तक) ज्ञात कीजिए।","oh":["5%","35%","17%","19%"],"eh":"नया आयतन = 0.54² × 3.61 = पुराने का 1.0527 गुना, लगभग 5% की वृद्धि।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"Vijay got an increase of 4% in his sales amount in the first year and 25% in the second year; also with this, his current sales are ₹1,50,800, what was his sales (in ₹) two years ago?","o":["₹1,20,640","₹96,000","₹1,16,000","₹1,45,000"],"a":2,"e":"Two years ago = 150800/(1.04 × 1.25) = 150800/1.3 = ₹1,16,000.","qh":"विजय को उसकी बिक्री राशि में पहले वर्ष में 4% की वृद्धि और दूसरे वर्ष में 25% की वृद्धि प्राप्त हुई; इसके साथ ही, उसकी वर्तमान बिक्री ₹1,50,800 है, दो वर्ष पूर्व उसकी बिक्री (₹ में) कितनी थी?","oh":["₹1,20,640","₹96,000","₹1,16,000","₹1,45,000"],"eh":"दो वर्ष पहले = 150800/(1.04 × 1.25) = 150800/1.3 = ₹1,16,000।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"The marks scored by 10 students are given below. 20, 16, 16, 19, 16, 12, 19, 10, 14, 18 The mode of the given data is:","o":["19","12","16","20"],"a":2,"e":"16 appears 3 times, the most of any value.","qh":"10 विद्यार्थियों द्वारा प्राप्त अंक नीचे दिए गए हैं। 20, 16, 16, 19, 16, 12, 19, 10, 14, 18 दिए गए आँकड़ों का बहुलक ज्ञात कीजिए।","oh":["19","12","16","20"],"eh":"16 तीन बार आता है, जो किसी भी अन्य मान से अधिक है।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"A store offers a discount of 14% on a television marked at ₹78,000. During a sale, an additional 8% discount is offered on the already discounted price. What is the total discount percentage?","o":["18.23%","20.88%","22.48%","21.62%"],"a":1,"e":"1 − 0.86 × 0.92 = 1 − 0.7912 = 20.88%.","qh":"एक स्टोर ₹78,000 की कीमत वाले टेलीविज़न पर 14% की छूट दे रहा है। सेल के दौरान, पहले से छूट वाली कीमत पर 8% की अतिरिक्त छूट दी जाती है। कुल छूट प्रतिशत ज्ञात कीजिए।","oh":["18.23%","20.88%","22.48%","21.62%"],"eh":"1 − 0.86 × 0.92 = 1 − 0.7912 = 20.88%।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"If the sum of the measures of all the interior angles of a regular polygon is 2520°, then what is the exterior angle of the polygon?","o":["42.5°","22.5°","37.5°","90°"],"a":1,"e":"(n − 2) × 180 = 2520, so n = 16. Exterior angle = 360/16 = 22.5°.","qh":"यदि एक समबहुभुज के सभी अंतः कोणों की मापों का योग 2520° है, तो बहुभुज का बहिष्कोण कितना होगा?","oh":["42.5°","22.5°","37.5°","90°"],"eh":"(n − 2) × 180 = 2520, अतः n = 16। बहिष्कोण = 360/16 = 22.5°।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"An amount of ₹570 is divided among three persons in the ratio of 2 : 12 : 11. The difference between the largest and the smallest shares (in ₹) in the distribution is:","o":["166","228","293","284"],"a":1,"e":"1 part = 570/25 = 22.8, so the difference = (12 − 2) × 22.8 = ₹228.","qh":"₹570 की धनराशि को तीन व्यक्तियों के बीच 2 : 12 : 11 के अनुपात में बांटा गया है। वितरण में सबसे बड़े और सबसे छोटे हिस्से में कितना अंतर (₹ में) है?","oh":["166","228","293","284"],"eh":"1 भाग = 570/25 = 22.8, अतः अंतर = (12 − 2) × 22.8 = ₹228।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"Find the surface area of a sphere with a radius of 5 cm. (Use π = 3.14)","o":["628 cm²","3140 cm²","31.4 cm²","314 cm²"],"a":3,"e":"4πr² = 4 × 3.14 × 25 = 314 cm².","qh":"5 cm त्रिज्या वाले गोले का पृष्ठीय क्षेत्रफल ज्ञात कीजिए। (π = 3.14 का उपयोग कीजिए)","oh":["628 cm²","3140 cm²","31.4 cm²","314 cm²"],"eh":"4πr² = 4 × 3.14 × 25 = 314 cm²।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"A sum of money triples itself at a certain rate of compound interest in 15 years. In how many years will it amount to 27 times of itself?","o":["39 years","45 years","55 years","36 years"],"a":1,"e":"3× in 15 years means 27× = 3³ in 45 years.","qh":"एक धनराशि चक्रवृद्धि ब्याज की एक निश्चित दर पर 15 वर्षों में तीन गुनी हो जाती है। कितने वर्षों में यह धनराशि 27 गुना हो जाएगी?","oh":["39 वर्ष","45 वर्ष","55 वर्ष","36 वर्ष"],"eh":"15 वर्षों में 3 गुना का अर्थ है 45 वर्षों में 27 गुना = 3³।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"An article is sold at a profit of 57%. If the cost price is increased by ₹20 and the selling price is reduced by ₹18, then the profit would be 47.5%. What is the original cost price (in ₹) of the article?","o":["200","500","300","400"],"a":1,"e":"1.57C − 18 = 1.475(C + 20), so 0.095C = 47.5 and C = ₹500.","qh":"एक वस्तु 57% लाभ पर बेची जाती है। यदि क्रय मूल्य में ₹20 की वृद्धि कर दी जाए और विक्रय मूल्य में ₹18 की कमी कर दी जाए, तो लाभ 47.5% होगा। वस्तु का मूल क्रय मूल्य (₹ में) कितना होगा?","oh":["200","500","300","400"],"eh":"1.57C − 18 = 1.475(C + 20), अतः 0.095C = 47.5 और C = ₹500।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"A number, when increased by 60%, gives 3610. The number is:","o":["2256.25","4512.5","1128.125","6768.75"],"a":0,"e":"1.6x = 3610, so x = 2256.25.","qh":"एक संख्या में 60% की वृद्धि करने पर 3610 प्राप्त होता है। वह संख्या ज्ञात कीजिए।","oh":["2256.25","4512.5","1128.125","6768.75"],"eh":"1.6x = 3610, अतः x = 2256.25।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"88 tube lights were purchased for ₹88, and 46 tube lights broke in transit. The trader sold the remaining tube lights at ₹3.10 each. Find his profit.","o":["₹47.10","₹48.20","₹42.20","₹36.60"],"a":2,"e":"He sells 42 × 3.10 = 130.20, so profit = 130.20 − 88 = ₹42.20.","qh":"88 ट्यूब-लाइटें ₹88 में खरीदी गईं, और 46 ट्यूब-लाइटें परिवहन के दौरान टूट गईं। व्यापारी ने शेष ट्यूब- लाइटें ₹3.10 प्रति ट्यूब-लाइट की दर से बेच दीं। उसका लाभ ज्ञात कीजिए।","oh":["₹47.10","₹48.20","₹42.20","₹36.60"],"eh":"वह 42 × 3.10 = 130.20 में बेचता है, अतः लाभ = 130.20 − 88 = ₹42.20।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"","o":["61x + 79","61x − 79","−61x + 79","−61x − 79"],"a":2,"img":"data/img/ntpc-2025-aug-29-s2/029ma-q0.png","e":"2(3/2 x² − 20x + 17) − 3(x² + 7x − 15) = 3x² − 40x + 34 − 3x² − 21x + 45 = −61x + 79.","eh":"2(3/2 x² − 20x + 17) − 3(x² + 7x − 15) = 3x² − 40x + 34 − 3x² − 21x + 45 = −61x + 79।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"Which of the following numbers divides 393064111?","o":["11","14","15","10"],"a":0,"e":"393064111: the alternating digit sum is 0, so it divides by 11.","qh":"संख्या 393064111 निम्न में से किससे विभाज्य है?","oh":["11","14","15","10"],"eh":"393064111: अंकों का एकांतर योग 0 है, अतः यह 11 से विभाज्य है।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Read the given statements and conclusions carefully. Assuming that the information given in the statements is true, even if it appears to be at variance with commonly known facts, decide which of the given conclusions logically follow(s) from the statements. Statements: Some orchids are cacti. No cactus is a marigold. Conclusions: (I) No marigold is a cactus. (II) Some cacti are orchids.","o":["Only conclusion (II) follows.","Neither conclusion (I) nor (II) follows.","Only conclusion (I) follows.","Both conclusions (I) and (II) follow."],"a":3,"e":"'No cactus is a marigold' converts to (I), and 'some orchids are cacti' converts to (II). Both follow.","qh":"दिए गए कथनों और निष्कर्षों का ध्यानपूर्वक अध्ययन कीजिए। यह मानते हुए कि कथनों में दी गई जानकारी सत्य है, भले ही वह सामान्यतः ज्ञात तथ्यों से भिन्न प्रतीत होती हो, तय कीजिए कि दिए गए निष्कर्षों में से कौन-से निष्कर्ष, कथनों का तार्किक रूप से अनुसरण करते हैं। कथन: सभी ईंट, चम्मच हैं। कोई भी ईंट, खेल नहीं है। निष्कर्ष (I): कुछ खेल, चम्मच हैं। निष्कर्ष (II): सभी चम्मच, खेल हैं।","oh":["केवल निष्कर्ष (II) अनुसरण करता है।","निष्कर्ष (I) और (II) दोनों अनुसरण करते हैं।","केवल निष्कर्ष (I) अनुसरण करता है।","न तो निष्कर्ष (I) और न ही (II) अनुसरण करता है।"],"eh":"'कोई कैक्टस गेंदा नहीं है' का परिवर्तन (I) है, और 'कुछ ऑर्किड कैक्टस हैं' का परिवर्तन (II) है। दोनों अनुसरण करते हैं।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Read the given statements and conclusions carefully. Assuming that the information given in the statements is true, even if it appears to be at variance with commonly known facts, decide which of the given conclusions logically follow(s) from the statements. Statements: Some orchids are cacti. No cactus is a marigold. Conclusions: (I) No marigold is a cactus. (II) Some cacti are orchids.","o":["Only conclusion (II) follows.","Neither conclusion (I) nor (II) follows.","Only conclusion (I) follows.","Both conclusions (I) and (II) follow."],"a":3,"e":"'No cactus is a marigold' converts to (I), and 'some orchids are cacti' converts to (II). Both follow.","qh":"दिए गए कथनों और निष्कर्षों को ध्यानपूर्वक पढ़िए। यह मानते हुए कि कथनों में दी गई जानकारी सत्य है, भले ही वह सामान्यतः ज्ञात तथ्यों से भिन्न प्रतीत होती हो, तय कीजिए कि दिए गए निष्कर्षों में से कौन-से निष्कर्ष कथनों का तार्किक रूप से अनुसरण करते हैं। कथन: कुछ ऑर्किड, कैक्टस हैं। कोई भी कैक्टस, मैरीगोल्ड नहीं है। निष्कर्ष: (I) कोई भी मैरीगोल्ड, कैक्टस नहीं है। (II) कुछ कैक्टस, ऑर्किड हैं।","oh":["केवल निष्कर्ष (II) अनुसरण करता है।","न तो निष्कर्ष (I) और न ही (II) अनुसरण करता है।","केवल निष्कर्ष (I) अनुसरण करता है।","निष्कर्ष (I) और (II) दोनों अनुसरण करते हैं।"],"eh":"'कोई कैक्टस गेंदा नहीं है' का परिवर्तन (I) है, और 'कुछ ऑर्किड कैक्टस हैं' का परिवर्तन (II) है। दोनों अनुसरण करते हैं।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"If ‘A’ stands for ‘÷’, ‘B’ stands for ‘×’, ‘C’ stands for ‘+’ and ‘D’ stands for ‘−’, then the resultant of which of the following would be 9?","o":["41 C 13 B 3 A 35 D 5","41 B 13 C 3 D 35 A 5","41 D 13 B 3 C 35 A 5","41 A 13 C 3 B 35 D 5"],"a":2,"e":"Option 3: 41 − 13 × 3 + 35 ÷ 5 = 41 − 39 + 7 = 9.","qh":"यदि ‘A’ का अर्थ ‘÷’ है, ‘B’ का अर्थ ‘×’ है, ‘C’ का अर्थ ‘+’ है और ‘D’ का अर्थ ‘−’ है, तो निम्नलिखित में से किसका परिणाम 9 होगा?","eh":"विकल्प 3: 41 − 13 × 3 + 35 ÷ 5 = 41 − 39 + 7 = 9।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Seven boxes, A, B, C, D, E, F and G, are kept one over the other but not necessarily in the same order. Only two boxes are kept below B. Only one box is kept above F. Only one box is kept between F and D. A is kept immediately above G. C is kept at some place below E. Which box is kept at the top?","o":["C","E","G","A"],"a":1,"e":"Top to bottom: E, F, C, D, B, A, G. E is on top.","qh":"सात बॉक्स, A, B, C, D, E, F और G, एक के ऊपर एक रखे गए हैं, परंतु जरूरी नहीं कि वे इसी क्रम में रखे गए हों। B के नीचे केवल दो बॉक्स रखे गए हैं। F के ऊपर केवल एक बॉक्स रखा गया है। F और D के बीच केवल एक बॉक्स रखा गया है। A को G के ठीक ऊपर रखा गया है। C को E के नीचे किसी स्थान पर रखा गया है। शीर्ष पर किस बॉक्स को रखा गया है?","oh":["C","E","G","A"],"eh":"ऊपर से नीचे: E, F, C, D, B, A, G। E सबसे ऊपर है।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"H, I, J, P, Q, R and S are sitting around a circular table facing the centre of the table. Q sits to the immediate right of J. Only three people sit between Q and S when counted from the left of Q. Only three people sit between J and H. P sits to the immediate right of R. How many people sit between J and R when counted from the right of R?","o":["One","Two","Three","Four"],"a":0,"e":"Going right from J: Q, I, H, S, R, P. Between R and J counting from R's right: only P, so one.","qh":"H, I, J, P, Q, R और S एक गोल मेज के परितः केंद्र की ओर अभिमुख होकर बैठे हैं। Q, J के ठीक दाईं ओर पड़ोस में बैठा है। Q के बाईं ओर से गिनने पर Q और S के बीच केवल तीन व्यक्ति बैठे हैं। J और H के बीच केवल तीन व्यक्ति बैठे हैं। P, R के ठीक दाईं ओर पड़ोस में बैठा है। R के दाईं ओर से गिनने पर J और R के बीच कितने व्यक्ति बैठे हैं?","oh":["एक","दो","तीन","चार"],"eh":"J से दाईं ओर: Q, I, H, S, R, P। R के दाएँ से गिनने पर R और J के बीच केवल P है, अतः एक।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Each of the digits in the number 9823415 is arranged in ascending order from left to right. What will be the sum of the digits which are second from the left and second from the right in the new number thus formed?","o":["10","11","9","8"],"a":0,"e":"Ascending: 1234589. 2 + 8 = 10.","qh":"संख्या 9823415 के प्रत्येक अंक को बाएं से दाएं आरोही क्रम में व्यवस्थित किया जाता है। इस प्रकार बनी नई संख्या में बाएं से दूसरे और दाएं से दूसरे अंकों का योग कितना होगा?","oh":["10","11","9","8"],"eh":"आरोही: 1234589। 2 + 8 = 10।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"In a certain code language, ‘GETS’ is coded as ‘8106’ and ‘EGIS’ is coded as ‘0167’. What is the code for ‘I’ in the given code language?","o":["1","7","0","6"],"a":1,"e":"G, E, S share 8/1/0/6 and 0/1/6/7 → common codes 0, 1, 6. So I = 7.","qh":"किसी निश्चित कूट भाषा में, ‘GETS’ को ‘8106’ और ‘EGIS’ को ‘0167’ के रूप में कूटबद्ध किया जाता है। दी गई कूट भाषा में ‘I’ का कूट क्या है?","oh":["1","7","0","6"],"eh":"G, E, S के कूट 8/1/0/6 और 0/1/6/7 → उभयनिष्ठ कूट 0, 1, 6। अतः I = 7।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"In a certain code language, 'A # B' means ‘A is the brother of B’, 'A % B' means ‘A is the daughter of B’, 'A = B' means ‘A is the wife of B’ and 'A ¥ B' means ‘A is the father of B’. How is D related to S if 'D = O # M ¥ E % S'?","o":["Father's brother's son","Father's brother's sister","Husband's brother's wife","Father's brother's daughter"],"a":2,"e":"M (E's father) is S's husband and O is M's brother. D, O's wife, is S's husband's brother's wife.","qh":"एक निश्चित कूट भाषा में, 'A # B' का अर्थ है, कि ‘A, B का भाई है’, 'A % B' का अर्थ है, कि ‘A, B की पुत्री है’, 'A = B' का अर्थ है, कि ‘A, B की पत्नी है’ और 'A ¥ B' का अर्थ है, कि ‘A, B का पिता है’। यदि 'D = O # M ¥ E % S' है, तो D का S से क्या संबंध है?","oh":["पिता के भाई का पुत्र","पिता के भाई की बहन","पति के भाई की पत्नी","पिता के भाई की पुत्री"],"eh":"M (E का पिता) S का पति है और O, M का भाई है। O की पत्नी D, S के पति के भाई की पत्नी है।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"What should come in place of the question mark (?) in the given series based on the English alphabetical order? SET DQE OCP ZOA ?","o":["KLA","KAL","LKA","LAK"],"a":1,"e":"Letters move +11, +12, +11: Z→K, O→A, A→L gives KAL.","qh":"अंग्रेजी वर्णमाला क्रम के आधार पर, दी गई शृंखला में प्रश्न-चिह्न (?) के स्थान पर क्या आना चाहिए? SET DQE OCP ZOA ?","oh":["KLA","KAL","LKA","LAK"],"eh":"अक्षर +11, +12, +11 खिसकते हैं: Z→K, O→A, A→L, अतः KAL।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"In the following triads, each group of letters is related to the subsequent one following a certain logic. Select from the given options, the one which follows the same logic. LOPE - LEPO - EPOL QUIT - QTIU - TIUQ","o":["BANG - BGNA - GNAB","SLOP - SLPO - LOPS","FILE - IFLE - EILF","WAST - WSAT - TSAW"],"a":0,"e":"Swap letters 2 and 4, then write the original word reversed. BANG → BGNA → GNAB.","qh":"निम्नलिखित त्रिकों में, प्रत्येक अक्षर-समूह एक निश्चित तर्क का अनुसरण करते हुए अगले समूह से संबंधित है। दिए गए विकल्पों में से उस विकल्प का चयन कीजिए, जो समान तर्क का अनुसरण करता है। LOPE - LEPO - EPOL QUIT - QTIU - TIUQ","oh":["BANG - BGNA - GNAB","SLOP - SLPO - LOPS","FILE - IFLE - EILF","WAST - WSAT - TSAW"],"eh":"दूसरे और चौथे अक्षर की अदला-बदली करें, फिर मूल शब्द को उल्टा लिखें। BANG → BGNA → GNAB।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"What should come in place of the question mark (?) in the given series? 9 19 39 69 109 ?","o":["150","160","155","159"],"a":3,"e":"Differences +10, +20, +30, +40, then +50: 109 + 50 = 159.","qh":"दी गई श्रृंखला में प्रश्न-चिन्ह (?) के स्थान पर क्या आएगा? 9 19 39 69 109 ?","oh":["150","160","155","159"],"eh":"अंतर +10, +20, +30, +40, फिर +50: 109 + 50 = 159।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Based on the English alphabetical order, three of the following four letter clusters are alike in a certain way and thus form a group. Which letter cluster DOES NOT belong to that group? (Note: The odd one out is not based on the number of consonants/vowels or their position in the letter-cluster.)","o":["GLH","EJF","NSO","LQN"],"a":3,"e":"The others are +5, −4 (G→L→H). LQN is +5, −3.","qh":"अंग्रेजी वर्णमाला क्रम पर आधारित, निम्नलिखित चार अक्षर-समूहों में से तीन एक निश्चित तरीके से एकसमान हैं और इस प्रकार वे एक ग्रुप बनाते हैं। कौन-सा अक्षर-समूह, उस ग्रुप से संबंधित नहीं है? (नोट: असंगत अक्षर-समूह, व्यंजनों/स्वरों की संख्या या उनकी स्थिति पर आधारित नहीं है।)","oh":["GLH","EJF","NSO","LQN"],"eh":"अन्य में +5, −4 है (G→L→H)। LQN में +5, −3 है।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"If 1 is added to each even digit and 2 is subtracted from each odd digit in the number 4268953, then how many digits will appear more than once in the new number thus formed?","o":["One","None","Three","Two"],"a":3,"e":"4268953 becomes 5379731. 3 and 7 repeat, so two digits.","qh":"यदि संख्या 4268953 के प्रत्येक सम अंक में 1 जोड़ा जाए तथा प्रत्येक विषम अंक में से 2 घटाया जाए, तो इस प्रकार बनी नई संख्या में कितने अंक एक से अधिक बार आएंगे?","oh":["एक","एक भी नहीं","तीन","दो"],"eh":"4268953, 5379731 बन जाता है। 3 और 7 दोहराए गए हैं, अतः दो अंक।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"What should come in place of the question mark (?) in the given series? 11, 33, 55, 77, ?, 121.","o":["109","101","111","99"],"a":3,"e":"Multiples of 11: 11 × 9 = 99.","qh":"दी गई शृंखला में प्रश्न-चिह्न (?) के स्थान पर क्या आना चाहिए? 11, 33, 55, 77, ?, 121","oh":["109","101","111","99"],"eh":"11 के गुणज: 11 × 9 = 99।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Sunil starts from Point A and travels 8 km towards north, turns left and travels 6 km, and then turns right and covers another 7 km. He then turns right and travels another 6 km. How far (shortest distance) is he from Point A? (All turns are 90-degree turns only.)","o":["4 km","5 km","10 km","15 km"],"a":3,"e":"Net position: 0 km east-west and 8 + 7 = 15 km north, so 15 km.","qh":"सुनील बिंदु A से चलना शुरू करता है और उत्तर की ओर 8 km की यात्रा करता है, बाएं मुड़ता है और 6 km की यात्रा करता है, और फिर दाएं मुड़ता है और 7 km की दूरी तय करता है। फिर वह दाएं मुड़ता है और 6 km की यात्रा करता है। वह बिंदु A से कितनी दूर (सबसे न्यूनतम दूरी) है? (सभी मोड़ केवल 90 डिग्री के मोड़ हैं।)","oh":["4 km","5 km","10 km","15 km"],"eh":"शुद्ध स्थिति: पूर्व-पश्चिम में 0 km और उत्तर में 8 + 7 = 15 km, अतः 15 km।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Ramu ran 60 km towards the west, turned left and ran 15 km. He then turned left and ran 40 km. In which direction is Ramu facing at the end? (All turns are 90 degrees unless specified)","o":["East","North","South","West"],"a":0,"e":"Heading west, a left turn faces south and another left faces east.","qh":"रामू पश्चिम की ओर 60 km दौड़ा, फिर बाएं मुड़ा और 15 km दौड़ा। फिर वह बाएं मुड़ा और 40 km दौड़ा। अंतत: रामू किस दिशा की ओर अभिमुख है? (जब तक अन्यथा विनिर्दिष्ट न किया गया हो, सभी मोड़ केवल 90° के मोड़ हैं )","oh":["पूर्व","उत्तर","दक्षिण","पश्चिम"],"eh":"पश्चिम की ओर जाते हुए बाएँ मुड़ने पर दक्षिण और फिर बाएँ मुड़ने पर पूर्व की ओर मुख होता है।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Based on the English alphabetical order, three of the following four letter-cluster pairs are alike in a certain way and thus form a group. Which letter-cluster pair DOES NOT belong to that group? (Note: The odd one out is not based on the number of consonants/vowels or their position in the letter-cluster.)","o":["GE−BC","TR−PN","RP−NL","WU−SQ"],"a":0,"e":"The others are −2 within each cluster and −4 across (T→R, T→P). GE−BC has B→C, which is +1.","qh":"अंग्रेजी वर्णमाला क्रम पर आधारित, निम्नलिखित चार अक्षर-समूह युग्मों में से तीन एक निश्चित तरीके से एकसमान हैं और इस प्रकार वे एक ग्रुप बनाते हैं। कौन-सा अक्षर-समूह युग्म, उस ग्रुप से संबंधित नहीं है? (नोट: असंगत अक्षर-समूह युग्म, व्यंजनों/स्वरों की संख्या या उनकी स्थिति पर आधारित नहीं है।)","oh":["GE−BC","TR−PN","RP−NL","WU−SQ"],"eh":"अन्य में समूह के भीतर −2 और समूहों के बीच −4 है (T→R, T→P)। GE−BC में B→C, अर्थात +1 है।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Refer to the following number and symbol series and answer the question that follows. Counting to be done from left to right only. (Note: All numbers are single digit numbers only). (Left) & 8 5 @ 1 £ 3 % 6 2 Ω # * 4 7 + $ 9 (Right) If all the symbols are dropped from the series, which of the following will be seventh from the right?","o":["0","2","1","3"],"a":2,"e":"Numbers only: 8 5 1 3 6 2 4 7 9. Seventh from the right is 1.","qh":"निम्नलिखित संख्या और प्रतीक श्रृंखला का संदर्भ लें और उसके बाद दिए गए प्रश्न का उत्तर दें। गिनती केवल बाएं से दाएं की जानी चाहिए। (नोट: सभी संख्याएँ केवल एकल अंक वाली संख्याएँ हैं)। (बाएं) & 8 5 @ 1 £ 3 % 6 2 Ω # * 4 7 + $ 9 (दाएं) यदि श्रृंखला से सभी प्रतीकों को हटा दिया जाए, तो निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सा दाएं से सातवां होगा?","oh":["0","2","1","3"],"eh":"केवल संख्याएँ: 8 5 1 3 6 2 4 7 9। दाएँ से सातवीं 1 है।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Refer to the following number and symbol series and answer the question that follows. All numbers are single-digit numbers. Counting to be done from left to right only. (Left) 9 # % 2 ^ @ 3 & 1 $ 5 Ω 7 % # 6 * £ 5 (Right) If all the symbols are dropped from the series, which of the following will be fifth from the right?","o":["5","1","3","7"],"a":1,"e":"Numbers only: 9 2 3 1 5 7 6 5. Fifth from the right is 1.","qh":"निम्नलिखित संख्या और प्रतीक श्रृंखला का संदर्भ लीजिए और नीचे दिए गए प्रश्न का उत्तर दीजिए। सभी संख्याएँ एकल-अंकीय संख्याएँ हैं। गिनती केवल बाएं से दाएं की जानी चाहिए। (बाएं) 9 # % 2 ^ @ 3 & 1 $ 5 Ω 7 % # 6 * £ 5 (दाएं) यदि श्रृंखला से सभी प्रतीकों को हटा दिया जाए, तो निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सा दाएं से पांचवें स्थान पर होगा?","oh":["5","1","3","7"],"eh":"केवल संख्याएँ: 9 2 3 1 5 7 6 5। दाएँ से पाँचवीं 1 है।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Which of the following letter-number clusters will replace the question mark (?) in the given series to make it logically complete? INQ23 JOR32 KPS41 LQT50 ?","o":["MRU58","MRV59","MRU59","MRV58"],"a":2,"e":"Each letter moves +1 and the number +9, giving MRU59.","qh":"निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सा अक्षर-संख्या समूह, दी गई श्रृंखला को तार्किक रूप से पूर्ण बनाने के लिए प्रश्न- चिह्न (?) को प्रतिस्थापित करेगा? INQ23 JOR32 KPS41 LQT50 ?","oh":["MRU58","MRV59","MRU59","MRV58"],"eh":"प्रत्येक अक्षर +1 और संख्या +9, अतः MRU59।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Select the triad that follows the same pattern as that followed by the two triads given below. Both triads follow the same pattern. HO-JQ-MP KR-MT-PS","o":["NU-PW-RV","MU-PW-RV","MU-OW-SV","NU-PW-SV"],"a":3,"e":"1st letters +2, +3 and 2nd letters +2, −1: N→P→S, U→W→V.","qh":"उस त्रिक का चयन कीजिए जो नीचे दिए गए दो त्रिकों के समान पैटर्न का अनुसरण करता है। दोनों त्रिक समान पैटर्न का अनुसरण करते हैं। HO-JQ-MP KR-MT-PS","oh":["NU-PW-RV","MU-PW-RV","MU-OW-SV","NU-PW-SV"],"eh":"पहले अक्षर +2, +3 और दूसरे अक्षर +2, −1: N→P→S, U→W→V।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"What should come in place of the question mark (?) in the given series? 162 ? 42 22 12 7","o":["82","78","76","74"],"a":0,"e":"Working backwards, the differences double: 7 +5 = 12, +10 = 22, +20 = 42, +40 = 82, +80 = 162.","qh":"दी गई शृंखला में प्रश्न-चिह्न (?) के स्थान पर क्या आना चाहिए? 162 ? 42 22 12 7","oh":["82","78","76","74"],"eh":"पीछे से देखने पर अंतर दोगुने होते हैं: 7 +5 = 12, +10 = 22, +20 = 42, +40 = 82, +80 = 162।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"In a row of 59 people facing the north, Bela sits 20th from the left end. If Ajeet sits 16th to the right of Bela, what is Ajeet's position from the right end of the line?","o":["26th","21st","22nd","24th"],"a":3,"e":"Ajeet is 20 + 16 = 36th from the left, which is 59 − 36 + 1 = 24th from the right.","qh":"उत्तर दिशा की ओर अभिमुख होकर बैठे 59 लोगों की एक पंक्ति में, बेला बाएं छोर से 20वें स्थान पर बैठी वें है। यदि अजीत, बेला के दाएं से 16 स्थान पर बैठा है, तो पंक्ति के दाएं छोर से अजीत का स्थान कौन-सा है?","oh":["26","21वां वां","22वां","24 वां"],"eh":"अजीत बाएँ से 20 + 16 = 36वें स्थान पर है, जो दाएँ से 59 − 36 + 1 = 24वाँ है।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"In a certain code language, ‘she has guts’ is coded as ‘bs kr ni’ and ‘packet has gone’ is coded as ‘ud ni gy’. How is ‘has’ coded in the given language?","o":["bs","ni","kr","ud"],"a":1,"e":"'has' is the common word and 'ni' is the common code.","qh":"एक निश्चित कूट भाषा में, ‘she has guts’ को ‘bs kr ni’ के रूप में कूटबद्ध किया गया है और ‘packet has gone’ को ‘ud ni gy’ के रूप में कूटबद्ध किया गया है। दी गई भाषा में ‘has’ को कैसे कूटबद्ध किया जाएगा?","oh":["bs","ni","kr","ud"],"eh":"'has' उभयनिष्ठ शब्द है और 'ni' उभयनिष्ठ कूट है।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"What will come in the place of the question mark (?) in the following equation, if ‘+’ and ‘÷’ are interchanged, and ‘−’ and ‘×’ are interchanged? 11 − 2 × 48 + 6 ÷ 15 = ?","o":["10","22","16","29"],"a":3,"e":"Becomes 11 × 2 − 48 ÷ 6 + 15 = 22 − 8 + 15 = 29.","qh":"यदि ‘+’ और ‘÷’ को परस्पर बदल दिया जाए, तथा ‘−’ और ‘×’ को परस्पर बदल दिया जाए, तो निम्नलिखित समीकरण में प्रश्न चिह्न (?) के स्थान पर क्या आएगा? 11 − 2 × 48 + 6 ÷ 15 = ?","oh":["10","22","16","29"],"eh":"यह 11 × 2 − 48 ÷ 6 + 15 = 22 − 8 + 15 = 29 बन जाता है।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"In the following triads, each group of letters is related to the subsequent one following a certain logic. Select from the given options, the one which follows the same logic. JUNE - UJNE - EUJN LAPS - ALPS - SALP","o":["BUGS - UBGS - SUGB","FROG - RFOG - GRFO","LOST - OLST - OSTL","MOVE - MVOE - EVOM"],"a":1,"e":"Swap the first two letters, then move the last letter to the front. FROG → RFOG → GRFO.","qh":"निम्नलिखित त्रिकों में, अक्षरों का प्रत्येक समूह किसी निश्चित तर्क का अनुसरण करते हुए अगले समूह से संबंधित है। दिए गए विकल्पों में से उस विकल्प का चयन कीजिए जो समान तर्क का अनुसरण करता हो। JUNE - UJNE - EUJN LAPS - ALPS - SALP","oh":["BUGS - UBGS - SUGB","FROG - RFOG - GRFO","LOST - OLST - OSTL","MOVE - MVOE - EVOM"],"eh":"पहले दो अक्षरों की अदला-बदली करें, फिर अंतिम अक्षर को आगे ले जाएँ। FROG → RFOG → GRFO।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Kunal ranked 29th from the top and 15th from the bottom in his class. How many students are there in his class?","o":["40","44","43","41"],"a":2,"e":"Total = 29 + 15 − 1 = 43.","qh":"वें कुणाल अपनी कक्षा में शीर्ष से 29 स्थान पर तथा नीचे से 15वें स्थान पर है। उसकी कक्षा में कितने विद्यार्थी हैं?","oh":["40","44","43","41"],"eh":"कुल = 29 + 15 − 1 = 43।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"L, M, N, O, Q, R and S are sitting around a circular table, facing the centre of the table. Q sits to the immediate right of N. Only three people sit between Q and S when counted from the left of Q. Only three people sit between N and M. L sits to the immediate right of R. How many people sit between O and R when counted from the left of R?","o":["Three","One","Two","Four"],"a":2,"e":"Going left from R: S and M come before O, so two people sit between them.","qh":"L, M, N, O, Q, R और S एक गोल मेज के परितः केंद्र की ओर अभिमुख होकर बैठे हैं। Q, N के ठीक दाईं ओर पड़ोस में बैठा है। Q के बाईं ओर से गिनती करने पर Q और S के बीच केवल तीन व्यक्ति बैठे हैं। N और M के बीच केवल तीन व्यक्ति बैठे हैं। L, R के ठीक दाईं ओर पड़ोस में बैठा है। R के बाईं ओर से गिनती करने पर O और R के बीच कितने व्यक्ति बैठे हैं?","oh":["तीन","एक","दो","चार"],"eh":"R से बाईं ओर: O से पहले S और M आते हैं, अतः उनके बीच दो व्यक्ति बैठे हैं।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Select the set in which the numbers are related in the same way as are the numbers of the following sets. (NOTE: Operations should be performed on the whole numbers, without breaking down the numbers into their constituent digits. E.g. 13 – Operations on 13 such as adding to/subtracting from/multiplying with 13 can be performed. Breaking down 13 into 1 and 3 and then performing mathematical operations on 1 and 3 is not allowed.) (26, 96, 22) (46, 108, 8)","o":["(7, 15, 1)","(1, 39, 19)","(30, 63, 2)","(24, 84, 18)"],"a":3,"e":"2nd = 2 × (1st + 3rd): 2 × (24 + 18) = 84.","qh":"उस समुच्चय का चयन कीजिए, जिसमें संख्याएं उसी प्रकार संबंधित हैं जिस प्रकार निम्नलिखित समुच्चय की संख्याएं संबंधित हैं। (नोट: संख्याओं को उनके घटक अंकों में तोड़े बिना, पूर्ण संख्याओं पर संक्रियाएं की जानी चाहिए। उदाहरण के लिए 13 लीजिए, 13 पर संक्रियाएं जैसे कि 13 में जोड़ना/घटाना/गुणा करना किया जा सकता है। 13 को 1 और 3 में तोड़ना तथा फिर 1 और 3 पर गणितीय संक्रियाएं करने की अनुमति नहीं है।) (26, 96, 22) (46, 108, 8)","oh":["(7, 15, 1)","(1, 39, 19)","(30, 63, 2)","(24, 84, 18)"],"eh":"दूसरी = 2 × (पहली + तीसरी): 2 × (24 + 18) = 84।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Based on the English alphabetical order, three of the following four letter-cluster pairs are alike in a certain way and thus form a group. Which letter-cluster pair DOES NOT belong to that group? (Note: The odd one out is not based on the number of consonants/vowels or their position in the letter-cluster pair.)","o":["CE-FH","SU-VX","KM-NO","AC-DF"],"a":2,"e":"The others are +2 within each cluster and +3 across (C→E, C→F). KM-NO has N→O, which is +1.","qh":"अंग्रेजी वर्णमाला क्रम पर आधारित, निम्नलिखित चार अक्षर-समूह युग्मों में से तीन एक निश्चित तरीके से एकसमान हैं और इस प्रकार वे एक ग्रुप बनाते हैं। कौन-सा अक्षर-समूह युग्म, उस ग्रुप से संबंधित नहीं है? (नोट: असंगत अक्षर-समूह युग्म, व्यंजनों/स्वरों की संख्या या उनकी स्थिति पर आधारित नहीं है।)","oh":["CE-FH","SU-VX","KM-NO","AC-DF"],"eh":"अन्य में समूह के भीतर +2 और समूहों के बीच +3 है (C→E, C→F)। KM-NO में N→O, अर्थात +1 है।"}]});
